---
import Section from '@/components/ui/Section.astro';
import Picture from '@/components/ui/Picture.astro';
---

<Section tone="stone" labelledby="what-title">
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-16">
    <div>
      <h2 id="what-title" class="text-h2">
        What the Guild is
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 flex max-w-[60ch] flex-col gap-5 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          The St. Joseph the Worker Guild is a Catholic fraternal organization for tradesmen, based
          at Saint Mary of Victories in St. Louis. It serves self-employed and small-shop Catholic
          tradesmen and their families: the plumbers, electricians, carpenters, roofers, and masons
          who keep the water running, the lights on, and the roofs over our heads.
        </p>
        <p>
          It exists because the men who care for other people's homes are often left to carry their
          own burdens alone. For a small independent tradesman there is usually no employer plan, no
          safety net, and no built-in community when work slows or crisis strikes. The Guild gives
          that brotherhood a home. Members pray together, trade labor, mentor one another, and give
          discounted and pro bono work to families, parishes, and schools in need.
        </p>
        <p class="font-sans text-[0.95rem] text-ash">
          Consecrated to St. Joseph the Worker and St. Louis IX as patrons.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Picture slot="guildAtWork" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 45vw, 100vw" aspect="4 / 3" />
  </div>
</Section>
